WEBVTT

00:01:56.121 --> 00:02:00.621
I know, I know, that for some of you,
when you hear the word "co-op,"

00:02:00.663 --> 00:02:04.246
you immediately think
of a white guy like me

00:02:04.288 --> 00:02:07.079
standing in a food
cooperative in Berkeley,

00:02:07.079 --> 00:02:08.913
selling you vegan cheese, right?

00:02:08.954 --> 00:02:09.996
(Laughter)

00:02:10.038 --> 00:02:12.746
And I love food cooperatives,

00:02:12.788 --> 00:02:15.371
but they are not the only
type of cooperative.

00:02:15.371 --> 00:02:20.538
Co-ops are really just a group of people
who have a shared need,

00:02:20.538 --> 00:02:23.371
be that vegan cheese or housecleaning,

00:02:23.371 --> 00:02:26.996
and they come together
to address that need.

00:02:27.454 --> 00:02:31.579
And that might be a business,